<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja-JP"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2633522515"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1772240257"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="アクマ - Devil"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MY FIRST STORY"/><amll:meta key="album" value="アクマ - Devil"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:37.000"><div begin="00:00.536" end="03:37.000"><p begin="00:00.536" end="00:02.586" itunes:key="L1">命の代償 払って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身负以生命为代价起誓的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no chi no da i sho u ha ra 't te chi ka 't ta u n me i</span></p><p begin="00:02.587" end="00:04.312" itunes:key="L2">誓った 運命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">誓约当下的命运</span></p><p begin="00:04.313" end="00:07.337" itunes:key="L3">愛以外ない人生だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是只为爱而存在的人生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i i ga i na i ji n se i da 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:07.338" end="00:11.980" itunes:key="L4">復讐心で溺れそうな海で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在似要因复仇心溺毙的海洋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ku shu u shi n de o bo re so u na u mi de</span></p><p begin="00:11.981" end="00:15.138" itunes:key="L5">愛は救いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱即为救赎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha su ku i da</span></p><p begin="00:27.312" end="00:30.397" itunes:key="L6">蒼い瞳の中に映った愛が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那双碧蓝眼眸中所映出的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o i hi to mi no na ka ni u tsu 't ta a i ga</span></p><p begin="00:30.398" end="00:33.412" itunes:key="L7">深い海の底に沈んでいるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经就此慢慢沉寂于深邃的海底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka i u mi no so ko ni shi zu n de i ru n da</span></p><p begin="00:33.413" end="00:36.537" itunes:key="L8">誰も彼も知ることのない表情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有那个任谁都不曾见过的表情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo ka re mo shi ru ko to no na i hyo u jo u</span></p><p begin="00:36.538" end="00:37.781" itunes:key="L9">笑顔 涙 君の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笑容 泪水 与你唯一的真相</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e ga o na mi da ki mi no shi n ji tsu ha hi to tsu</span></p><p begin="00:37.782" end="00:39.522" itunes:key="L10">真実はひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真容至此唯一</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e ga o na mi da ki mi no shi n ji tsu ha hi to tsu</span></p><p begin="00:39.632" end="00:45.469" itunes:key="L11">砂漠の中から一粒のルビーを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同要将沙漠中的那颗红宝石</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ba ku no na ka ka ra hi to tsu bu no ru bi i wo</span></p><p begin="00:45.470" end="00:51.612" itunes:key="L12">見つけるような難題を 何回も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次又一次寻觅而出的艰巨难题</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu ke ru yo u na na n da i wo na n ka i mo</span></p><p begin="00:51.613" end="00:56.127" itunes:key="L13">解き続けるそのために<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为能坚持不懈地解开答案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki tsu du ke ru so no ta me ni</span></p><p begin="00:56.128" end="00:57.731" itunes:key="L14">演じるだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍会竭力演绎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e n ji ru da ro u</span></p><p begin="00:57.732" end="01:03.927" itunes:key="L15">これは僕なりの愛だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是只属于我的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ha bo ku na ri no a i da</span></p><p begin="01:03.928" end="01:06.989" itunes:key="L16">悪魔でも飽くまでも 許さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算是恶魔也绝对不会宽恕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ku ma de mo a ku ma de mo yu ru sa na i</span></p><p begin="01:06.990" end="01:09.953" itunes:key="L17">奪うだけの訳などない 逃さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不仅仅是一场掠夺 绝不会放手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ba u da ke no wa ke na do na i ni ga sa na i</span></p><p begin="01:09.954" end="01:12.174" itunes:key="L18">アクアでも悪魔でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论阿库亚还是恶魔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ku a de mo a ku ma de mo</span></p><p begin="01:12.175" end="01:15.322" itunes:key="L19">報いは然るべく受けるだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后终究会承受应有的因果吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ku i ha shi ka ru be ku u ke ru da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:15.323" end="01:17.584" itunes:key="L20">命の代償 払って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身负以生命为代价起誓的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no chi no da i sho u ha ra 't te chi ka 't ta u n me i</span></p><p begin="01:17.585" end="01:19.115" itunes:key="L21">誓った運命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">誓约当下的命运</span></p><p begin="01:19.116" end="01:22.223" itunes:key="L22">愛以外ない人生だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是只为爱而存在的人生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i i ga i na i ji n se i da 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:22.224" end="01:26.861" itunes:key="L23">復讐心で溺れそうな海で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在似要因复仇心溺毙的海洋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ku shu u shi n de o bo re so u na u mi de</span></p><p begin="01:26.862" end="01:40.815" itunes:key="L24">愛は救いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱即为救赎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha su ku i da</span></p><p begin="01:40.816" end="01:43.642" itunes:key="L25">紅い瞳の奥に映った愛が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在红色眼眸深处所映照的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ka i hi to mi no o ku ni u tsu 't ta a i ga</span></p><p begin="01:43.643" end="01:46.687" itunes:key="L26">遠く離れた先照らしているんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将遥远无比的前路就此璀璨照亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku ha na re ta sa ki te ra shi te i ru n da</span></p><p begin="01:46.688" end="01:49.796" itunes:key="L27">誰も彼も知ることのない愛情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有任谁都不曾知晓的爱意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo ka re mo shi ru ko to no na i a i jo u</span></p><p begin="01:49.797" end="01:51.448" itunes:key="L28">笑顔 涙 君の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笑容 泪水 与你唯一的真相</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e ga o na mi da ki mi no shi n ji tsu ha hi to tsu</span></p><p begin="01:51.449" end="01:52.572" itunes:key="L29">真実はひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真容至此唯一</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku o ku no ra re tsu no na ka de e ra bi nu i ta</span></p><p begin="01:52.573" end="01:58.876" itunes:key="L30">幾億の羅列の中で 選び抜いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从数亿罗列的话语中反复斟酌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku o ku no ra re tsu no na ka de e ra bi nu i ta</span></p><p begin="01:58.877" end="02:04.993" itunes:key="L31">言葉の意味を背負ってる 纏っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所选择的话语蕴含着意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba no i mi wo se o 't te ru</span></p><p begin="02:04.994" end="02:11.105" itunes:key="L32">いつかの星の煌めき 映したなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是往日的星星映照出了夺目光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka no ho shi no ki ra me ki u tsu shi ta na ra</span></p><p begin="02:11.106" end="02:17.043" itunes:key="L33">なぞるB線上のアリア<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便会成为B线上描摹的咏叹调</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na zo ru B se n jo u no a ri a</span></p><p begin="02:17.044" end="02:20.268" itunes:key="L34">悪魔でも飽くまでも 許さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算是恶魔也绝对不会宽恕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ku ma de mo a ku ma de mo yu ru sa na i</span></p><p begin="02:20.269" end="02:23.303" itunes:key="L35">奪うだけの訳などない 逃さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不仅仅是一场掠夺 绝不会放手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ba u da ke no wa ke na do na i ni ga sa na i</span></p><p begin="02:23.304" end="02:25.470" itunes:key="L36">燃え盛る愛の元<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱之源熊熊燃烧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo e za ka ru a i no mo to</span></p><p begin="02:25.471" end="02:28.715" itunes:key="L37">報いは然るべく受けるだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后终究会承受应有的因果吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ku i ha shi ka ru be ku u ke ru da ro u</span></p><p begin="02:28.716" end="02:30.919" itunes:key="L38">命の代償 払って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身负以生命为代价起誓的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no chi no da i sho u ha ra 't te chi ka 't ta u n me i</span></p><p begin="02:30.920" end="02:32.507" itunes:key="L39">誓った運命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">誓约当下的命运</span></p><p begin="02:32.508" end="02:35.519" itunes:key="L40">愛以外ない人生だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是只为爱而存在的人生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i i ga i na i ji n se i da 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:35.520" end="02:40.162" itunes:key="L41">復讐心で溺れそうな君へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对似要因复仇心溺毙的你来说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ku shu u shi n de o bo re so u na ki mi he</span></p><p begin="02:40.163" end="02:43.270" itunes:key="L42">愛は救いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱即为救赎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha su ku i da</span></p><p begin="02:43.271" end="02:46.093" itunes:key="L43">彷徨う旋律 たゆたう真実<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旋律彷徨盘旋 真相飘忽不定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ma yo u se n ri tsu ta yu ta u shi n ji tsu</span></p><p begin="02:46.094" end="02:49.243" itunes:key="L44">その先で何を思う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">之后你将作何感想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no sa ki de na ni wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="02:49.244" end="02:52.295" itunes:key="L45">記憶の回数 痛みを反芻<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在数次回忆中反复品味痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki o ku no ka i su u i ta mi wo ha n su u</span></p><p begin="02:52.296" end="02:55.371" itunes:key="L46">心燃やし続けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心灵仍在灼灼燃烧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro mo ya shi tsu du ke ta</span></p><p begin="02:55.372" end="02:58.360" itunes:key="L47">掛け違う運命 出会う交差点<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失之交臂的命运邂逅于岔路口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke chi ga u u n me i de a u ko u sa te n</span></p><p begin="02:58.361" end="03:01.538" itunes:key="L48">生きる意味を探した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">探寻着何为生存意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki ru i mi wo sa ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="03:01.539" end="03:07.469" itunes:key="L49">これは僕なりの愛だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是只属于我的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ha bo ku na ri no a i da</span></p><p begin="03:07.470" end="03:10.595" itunes:key="L50">悪魔でも飽くまでも 許さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算是恶魔也绝对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ku ma de mo a ku ma de mo</span></p><p begin="03:10.596" end="03:13.779" itunes:key="L51">悪魔でも飽くまで 許さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算是恶魔也绝对不会宽恕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ku ma de mo a ku ma de mo yu ru sa na i</span></p><p begin="03:13.780" end="03:16.869" itunes:key="L52">奪うだけの訳などない 逃さない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不仅仅是一场掠夺 绝不会放手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ba u da ke no wa ke na do na i ni ga sa na i</span></p><p begin="03:16.870" end="03:19.085" itunes:key="L53">アクアでも悪魔でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论阿库亚还是恶魔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ku a de mo a ku ma de mo</span></p><p begin="03:19.086" end="03:22.211" itunes:key="L54">報いは然るべく受けるだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后终究会承受应有的因果吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ku i ha shi ka ru be ku u ke ru da ro u</span></p><p begin="03:22.212" end="03:24.455" itunes:key="L55">命の代償 払って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身负以生命为代价起誓的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no chi no da i sho u ha ra 't te chi ka 't ta u n me i</span></p><p begin="03:24.456" end="03:26.780" itunes:key="L56">誓った運命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">誓约当下的命运</span></p><p begin="03:26.781" end="03:29.079" itunes:key="L57">愛以外ない人生だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是只为爱而存在的人生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i i ga i na i ji n se i da 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:29.080" end="03:33.711" itunes:key="L58">復讐心で溺れそうな海で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在似要因复仇心溺毙的海洋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ku shu u shi n de o bo re so u na u mi de</span></p><p begin="03:33.712" end="03:37.000" itunes:key="L59">愛は救いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱即为救赎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ha su ku i da</span></p></div></body></tt>